            "title": "US-China trade talks end as hopes of a deal build",
            "snippets": [
              "# US-China trade talks end as hopes of a deal build\nPublished Wed, Jan 9 2019 7:11 AM EST\n\nWATCH LIVE\n\nKey Points\n\n- Chinese and U.S. teams ended trade talks in Beijing on Wednesday that lasted longer than expected.\n- Officials said details will be released soon, raising hopes an all-out trade war that could badly disrupt the global economy can be avoided.\n- The talks were extended into an unscheduled third day, showing both sides were \"serious,\" China's Foreign Ministry said",
